art husband in their first year of marriage, and has stubbornly remained faithful to him for the past three years."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since her husband's death, she has been living off of pornographic novels. Perhaps in reaction to her grief over the loss of her husband and the small betrayals she commits night after night, she does not show more emotion than necessary toward outsiders."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30981"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96dcce447ef283ae97638705dcce350fc25331b6bf952e3755cb4907dfaa75b4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c2d84de49165c08bc9a339b2b1b82a5eaff48e4f03ad75ef2e738beb13f37c5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"児玉 さとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s115","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s115","name":"児玉 さとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21286","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30983","characterName":"九十九 好美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30983"},"originalCharacterName":"九十九 好美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She married her husband of three years after an office romance. However, soon after their marriage, she gains a lot of weight, and her husband's love for her rapidly cools."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After falling madly in love with Yuusuke's gentle personality, she begins to make efforts to become as beautiful as before. However, it is not because she is trying to be a good girlfriend, but simply because she does not want the person she loves to see her disgusting behavior any more."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30983"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72fbe3fbb837674e999e9b9cce9121796f113259417d53ab0311f57313ad05f7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/4257b69f5daa869540e9f797eb269ca7a8cddc73c94b640e95c9f8902cfea05c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永瀬 江美弥","creatorId":"vndb:s61","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s61","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s61","name":"永瀬 いくみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21285","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30985","characterName":"英 乙音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30985"},"originalCharacterName":"英 乙音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been married for 18 years, however, no one has ever seen her husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a mysterious woman living alone in Room 101. It is said that someone is threatening her, putting her under house arrest, and tormenting her, but she is not sure who it is."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa411e3dd8bae806422de62e71be656932c62b88901d4b73ed4a5365b4e50d14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01aed0b9f5bc5ff42140bc0d7694a0c3e1ea2ccebbe8be931bbbd1e0dc4a9523.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":